{"hymn":"S841","parent":"E997","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":1,"merge":0},"title":"Mi dice el Salvador","subtitle":"El evangelio—La redención","syl":{"n1":"Mi","n3":["di","i"],"n4":["ce‿el","t"],"n5":["Sal","i"],"n6":["va","m"],"n7":["dor:","t"],"n8":"\"Muy","n9":["dé","i"],"n10":["bil","t"],"n11":["e","i"],"n12":["res","t"],"n13":"tú,","n14":"Ven","n15":"y","n16":["ve","i"],"n17":["la‿en","t"],"n18":["o","i"],"n19":["ra","m"],"n20":["ción;","t"],"n21":["Se","i"],"n22":["ré","t"],"n23":"tu","n24":["ple","i"],"n25":["ni","m"],"n26":["tud\".","t","u"],"n27":0,"n28":["To","i"],"n29":["do","t"],"n30":["de","i"],"n31":["bo","t"],"n32":"a‿Él,","n34":["To","i"],"n35":["do","t"],"n36":"Él","n37":["pa","i"],"n38":["gó;","t"],"n40":"El","n41":["pe","i"],"n42":["ca","m"],"n43":["do","t"],"n44":"me","n45":["man","i"],"n46":["chó,","t"],"n47":"Mas","n48":["Cris","i"],"n49":["to","t"],"n50":"me","n51":["la","i"],"n52":["vó.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Señor, Tu gran poder","Mi lepra ya sanó;","Y mi duro corazón,","Tu amor lo derritió."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["En mí no mora el bien,","Tu gracia aceptaré;","En Tu sangre eficaz","Mis ropas lavaré."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Y, frente al trono fiel,","Completo en Él seré;","\"Mi Jesús por mi murió\",","Aún repetiré."]}]}